        <mxCell id="c1" value="1) Keep split GA architecture and harden network\n- Stable proxy routing\n- DNS policy for Alfred endpoint\n- Authenticated GitHub API quota strategy" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#f9a825;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="laneC">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="50" width="640" height="130" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c2" value="2) Switch to full Jenkins architecture\n- Single network zone for ingestion + Alfred + upload\n- Lower cloud dependency\n- Migration and ownership impact" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#f9a825;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="laneC">
          <mxGeometry x="700" y="50" width="640" height="130" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c3" value="3) Hybrid governance\n- GitHub as control plane\n- ST self-hosted as execution plane for network-sensitive steps\n- Explicit quality gates before upload" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#f9a825;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="laneC">
